on] that the Messenger may be a witness over you and you may be witnesses over the people. So establish prayer and give zakāh and hold fast to Allāh. He is your protector; and excellent is the protector, and excellent is the helper.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":78,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":34,"surahs":[22],"sajdah":false}